commit f734655387f0478f764c8de59428a2007c8f4801
Author: hazellealagasca <lagascahazellea@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 10 01:20:23 2026 +0800

    Collection receipt: verify the overall amount, then Complete / Issue Receipt
    
    The receipt form shows what billing carried over (statement or invoice,
    client, invoices, trip reports, freight + fuel - withholding = overall
    amount due). The person must tick "I checked the overall amount" before
    Complete / Issue Receipt is allowed, and the checked amount is sent with the
    save: a receipt is issued only for exactly that amount.
    
    Issuing the receipt marks the invoice and statement Paid and keeps the trip
    reports billed, in one transaction. A statement's own invoice now also turns
    its trip reports Invoiced when it is issued.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

